The code search engine in src/engine (the TypeSafe Jev client, the circuit
breaker and the code_search pipeline) and its tests in test/engine were ported
from OpenGeni's packages/jev at commit
fe7ea0a6cf3f094cd00bbf066a2107fef049fe19. Changes made after the port are
recorded in this repository's git history and CHANGELOG.md. The code search
instruction (CODE_SEARCH_DIRECTIVE), used by the MCP server and the agent
skill, comes from OpenGeni's packages/runtime at the same commit. The agent
instructions in README.md, the MCP tool description and the agent skill are
adapted from OpenGeni's code_search tool description. The evaluation results
in README.md were measured on OpenGeni's code_search tool.

genigrep runs ripgrep (https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep, MIT or Unlicense)
through the @vscode/ripgrep npm package (MIT) or a ripgrep binary already
installed on the system. ripgrep is not bundled in this source repository.
